This directory contains the linear Alembic history for trpc-agent-service.
The current schema head is `20260909_0026`.

Local startup runs `upgrade head` through `start.sh`; Kubernetes uses the
one-shot `database-migration` Job before rolling application Deployments.
Application replicas never create production tables implicitly.

For development diagnostics only, run:

    uv run alembic -c trpc_service/storage/alembic.ini heads
    uv run alembic -c trpc_service/storage/alembic.ini current

Do not edit an applied revision. Add a new revision and verify both upgrade and
downgrade against an isolated database.
